 "strings": [
  "",
  "Having escaped New Hong Kong,",
  "the Audhumla",
  "was heading for New Guinea.",
  "That",
  "was no pleasant thing at all",
  "for Ben Woodar and Bran Blutarch,",
  "who had pursued the Audhumla",
  "all the way from North America.",
  "If the Audhumla went down",
  "at New Guinea,",
  "any credit of their own",
  "would be gone.",
  "At all costs, they wanted",
  "to sink the Audhumla",
  "over the Philippines,",
  "the regular forces' territory;",
  "that was their true intent.",
  "But the Sudori, never",
  "properly resupplied,",
  "was in worsening shape.",
  "With no spare parts,",
  "they had scrapped one of their",
  "two Hizacks, cannibalizing it",
  "to keep the other running.",
  "The Psycho Gundam above all",
  "was a headache that gobbled up",
  "materials.",
  "Aboard the Sudori",
  "Woodar",
  "\"What's the Audhumla's status?\"",
  "Soldier",
  "\"We'll have it in range shortly.\"",
  "\"And when is 'shortly'!?\"",
  "\"That's...!\"",
  "\"Report accurately!\"",
  "\"My apologies.\"",
  "\"How do you feel, Ensign Four?\"",
  "Four",
  "\"...Am I to sortie?\"",
  "\"Don't be hasty.",
  " We haven't caught",
  " the Audhumla yet.\"",
  "「……」",
  "\"Where are you going?\"",
  "\"I'll go back.\"",
  "\"I hear you want your memories,",
  " Ensign Four.\"",
  "\"Lieutenant...?\"",
  "\"I'm not asking you to sink it.",
  " Just stop it in its tracks.\"",
  "\"At this rate, we'll simply hand",
  " the Audhumla over to the Titans",
  " in New Guinea.\"",
  "\"If our standing falls any further,",
  " at worst the Newtype Lab",
  " could even be shut down.\"",
  "\"Shut down?\"",
  "\"If that happens,",
  " your memories, Four-kun,",
  " will stay lost forever.\"",
  "\"B-but...\"",
  "\"It all comes down to results.\"",
  "\"I won't let",
  " the Titans get in my way.\"",
  "\"Oh...! How very brave.\"",
  "\"Audhumla located!",
  " Contact in... about 15 minutes.\"",
  "\"Can't even master her feelings.",
  " Is this the limit",
  " of a manufactured Newtype...?\"",
  "\"But that may yet produce",
  " an unexpected result.\"",
  "\"...Ready the Psycho Gundam!",
  " Hizack team, hurry it up!\"",
  "Woodar",
  "had made one mistake.",
  "That Four",
  "could not control her feelings",
  "was not only because she was",
  "a \"manufactured Newtype.\"",
  "She had reason to be troubled,",
  "and reason to be shaken.",
  "Aboard the Audhumla",
  "was the one she longed for,",
  "Kamille Bidan.",
  "Children of the Dom",
  "Earth Federation Forces",
  "The urge to make mobile suits",
  "fly through the sky",
  "was nothing new.",
  "Since they were developed",
  "as general-purpose weapons,",
  "engineers naturally wanted them",
  "to handle air combat too,",
  "and a fusion reactor's output",
  "let them dream",
  "that it might be possible.",
  "But in Zeon and Federation alike,",
  "these attempts all but failed.",
  "Lifting a lump of titanium",
  "of nearly 100 tons was hard",
  "even for the finest",
  "thermonuclear jet engine.",
  "Better instead",
  "to mount the machine",
  "on a Sub-Flight System",
  "like the Dodai YS or G-Fighter",
  "for long-range operations,",
  "or air-drop it from",
  "a Medea transport or a Gunperry.",
  "Indeed, the Federation",
  "soon came to this conclusion",
  "and gave up researching flying MS",
  "for the rest of the war.",
  "But Zeon's forces were different.",
  "They did not know the Earth.",
  "They had no fixed notion",
  "that the sky could not be flown.",
  "Conquering mere 1G gravity",
  "would be the very thing",
  "to prove Zeon's people chosen,",
  "or so it was thought.",
  "The first machine developed",
  "at California Base",
  "was the MS-07H type.",
  "Built on the Gouf, stripped down",
  "to the bare limit,",
  "and fitted with a thermonuclear",
  "jet engine, this machine",
  "could, by blasting out thrust,",
  "at least manage to fly.",
  "There was a problem, though.",
  "To get lift,",
  "it had to keep its legs",
  "pointed downward,",
  "so though it could fly, its speed",
  "going forward was nothing much.",
  "To put it plainly,",
  "it was a giant helicopter.",
  "That could never be",
  "an air combat weapon.",
  "But the Dom type,",
  "born as a spin-off",
  "of this research,",
  "found fresh promise",
  "after the war.",
  "The idea of fitting high-output",
  "thrusters all over the body",
  "merged with magnetic coating,",
  "the movable frame and other",
  "technologies of a new era,",
  "and arrived at a design that",
  "gained lift and propulsion",
  "by angling its thrusters",
  "as needed.",
  "The resulting machines,",
  "the Asshimar and Gaplant,",
  "proved terribly",
  "unstable,",
  "but in a dogfight",
  "that worked in their favor.",
  "Both machines",
  "used a cross-shaped sensor,",
  "and in details like their flared",
  "leg skirts, the Dom lives on.",
  "The AEUG, too, had fielded",
  "the Rick Dias",
  "as a heavy MS,",
  "so one might say this era",
  "was shaped by",
  "the children of the Dom.",
  "In this era, the Earth Federation",
  "Forces' chief aim was jobs.",
  "The One Year War had ended",
  "and many soldiers were discharged,",
  "yet the Federation Forces still",
  "reigned over the Earth Sphere",
  "with far too much military might.",
  "Partly this was to counter",
  "Zeon remnants and to keep",
  "the Republic of Zeon in check,",
  "but beyond that, there was a fear",
  "that without the system known",
  "as the Earth Federation Forces,",
  "society itself",
  "could not hold together.",
  "An army is not a system",
  "that merely exists.",
  "The food soldiers eat,",
  "the clothes soldiers wear,",
  "the fuel soldiers burn,",
  "materials to build bases...",
  "All of it is, in effect, an industry",
  "that creates jobs all around it.",
  "Joining the army, whatever else,",
  "meant having a job,",
  "and people who wanted to serve",
  "quietly until they reached",
  "pension age",
  "came flocking to the army.",
  "Units as gung-ho",
  "as the ones",
  "in TV dramas and movies",
  "were few and far between,",
  "as can be seen from how",
  "the Albion, which had put down",
  "the Delaz Conflict, was left",
  "out in the cold.",
  "A wish to keep out of trouble",
  "and just get through the present",
  "held sway over the whole",
  "Federation Forces.",
  "They shut themselves up",
  "in their bases and were content",
  "with making",
  "routine patrols.",
  "Not only in space:",
  "the same was happening on Earth.",
  "In truth, humanity had never",
  "managed to build an efficient",
  "military body to oversee",
  "the entire Earth.",
  "Behind federalism's fine name,",
  "the reality was regional forces",
  "each passing the buck",
  "to one another.",
  "That is precisely why",
  "the Delaz Fleet, Zeon remnants,",
  "could hijack a colony,",
  "and why the AEUG",
  "somehow came to possess",
  "cruisers and MS no one had seen,",
  "without anyone noticing.",
  "Even so, no one",
  "responsible was",
  "ever punished.",
  "They covered for each other",
  "and justified themselves",
  "with the stock phrase",
  "\"It couldn't be helped.\"",
  "That may be",
  "a way to get by in the world,",
  "but it does not make",
  "the real threat go away.",
  "The Sudori's crew",
  "were different.",
  "They were born warriors,",
  "many of whom had volunteered",
  "for the One Year War.",
  "Clinging to them were",
  "the values humankind",
  "has known since its beginning:",
  "battle, and the advancement",
  "that battle could win.",
  "The Sudori unit",
  "was wiped out, powerless",
  "against the Audhumla.",
  "Their actions",
  "may have been foolish,",
  "but one may also call them",
  "men of the old school, who never",
  "bowed to the Earth Federation.",
  "Not every person, after all,",
  "is able to live",
  "so deftly."
 ]
